    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Tubular headboard and footboard with vertical spindles, side rails, cast joint collars and a full wire-spring mattress deck, all visible in the top and bottom views. Chipped white paint over rust tracks the tubes believably. The 4 is for topology: 50k triangles, most of it in the spring grid.",
    "limitations": [
      "50k triangles, largely the wire spring deck; replace with a plane if it will be covered by a mattress.",
      "Frame only: no mattress or bedding included."
    ],
